--- /dev/null
+++ b/demos/ecmp.dem
@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@
+# ecmp.dem — Story 2.2: ECMP across a diamond (first harness-level regression
+# coverage for the 2.2 hash; the unit tests live in core/ecmp_test.odin). The
+# demo defines its WHOLE topology via the spawn_node directive (`fixture off`):
+#   id 0 = residential res  at (8, 15)  — the source (top)
+#   id 1 = router_basic m1  at (20, 9)  — mid router (upper)
+#   id 2 = router_basic m2  at (20, 21) — mid router (lower)
+#   id 3 = content_host host at (32, 15) — the sink (bottom)
+# the 2.2 unit-test diamond — every span 13 (<= standard max 14), so the four
+# edges draw legal at the 'standard' tier. Node ids are SPAWN ORDER (0-based,
+# monotonic — E11): fixture off, so the four spawn_node lines own ids 0..3.
+#
+# Draw the four edges at 500ms (apply tick 11) -> from res toward host there
+# are TWO equal-cost next hops (m1, m2) — the ECMP junction. Four packets
+# residential(0) -> content_host(3) spawn at 1000/1100/1200/1300ms (ticks
+# 20/22/24/26). The pure hash splitmix64(src,dst,class,pkt_id) mod 2 picks:
+#   pkt1 -> m2 · pkt2 -> m1 · pkt3 -> m2 · pkt4 -> m1 (alternating — both
+# paths used, flow affinity: same packet -> same path every replay).
+#
+# Transit (bandwidth 30 vs standard cap 15 -> 2 ticks/edge): each packet takes
+# res->mid (2 ticks), mid->host (2 ticks), +2 forwarding ticks = 6 ticks, e.g.
+# pkt1 (t20): t20 fwd res->m2 · t21 mid · t22 arrive m2 · t23 fwd m2->host ·
+# t24 mid · t25 DELIVER. The captures pin the SPLIT mid-flight:
+#   at 1250ms (t25) pkt2 sits AT m1 (arrived t24, just forwarding onto the
+#     m1->host leg) while pkt3 is half-way down the res->m2 leg — both
+#     equal-cost paths carrying traffic simultaneously;
+#   at 1350ms (t27) pkt3 sits AT m2 while pkt4 is half-way down the res->m1
+#     leg (the split, mirrored on the opposite legs);
+#   3000ms pins the settled topology (all delivered).
+seed 42
+run 4000ms
+fixture off
+spawn_node residential 8 15
+spawn_node router_basic 20 9
+spawn_node router_basic 20 21
+spawn_node content_host 32 15
+at 500ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 500ms draw 0 2 standard
+at 500ms draw 1 3 standard
+at 500ms draw 2 3 standard
+at 1000ms spawn 0 3
+at 1100ms spawn 0 3
+at 1200ms spawn 0 3
+at 1300ms spawn 0 3
+capture at 1250ms
+capture at 1350ms
+capture at 3000ms
+expect hash stable
